                <note rend="inline" type="source">423.11 L 23/318: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Ambassador in Peru</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Gonzales</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1921-04-16T14:00:00-05:00"><hi rendition="#italic">April 16,
                                1921—2 p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>23. Your 27, April 9, 9 a.m.</p>
                <p>Department agrees to amendment Landreau protocol to provide for Commission
                    sitting in country third member or president of board.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hughes</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
